    {
      "id": 104448,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-05-23T14:32:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"imprimis5\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/imprimis5/48/2387_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> imprimis5:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>a contractor specialising in collateral damage repair</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ah, good old <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Damage_Control_%28comics%29\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Damage Control</a>.&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>I love the idea! \"Have you had parts of a building or giant robot fall on your car? Do you have a hole blasted through your house by high-energy cannons that missed their targets? Is little Tammy's treefort now in a giant monster's stomach? We can set things right, because we're Collateral Damage Repair (or something that sounds better)! We'll work with your insurance company to get your property back to where it should be - even if it's currently in another dimension.\"</p>\n<p>It just writes itself!  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=12\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:33:49.919Z",
